    end

    FE[React + TypeScript frontend]
    HUMAN[Supply chain manager]

    Sources --> SCHED --> GRAPH
    GRAPH <--> DB
    API <--> DB
    FE <--> API
    GRAPH -. pending_approval .-> API
    API -. approve / reject .-> HUMAN --> FE
